OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 23 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Amy Beach
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how Amy
OL,6,     GBeach railed against the sexism
OL,7,     Gof her time to journey from a
OL,8,     Gchild piano prodigy to a
OL,9,     Grespected composer.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,12,     Gfrom singers Beverley Knight and
OL,13,     GNtombizodwa Ndlovu, with
OL,14,     Gguitarist Shirley Tetteh, plus
OL,15,     Gviolinist Pekka Kuusisto and folk
OL,16,     Gmusician Sam Amidon.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape including music by
OL,20,     GEvelyn Glennie, Grieg, Corelli,
OL,21,     GMilhaud, William Grant Smith and
OL,22,     GLili Boulanger.
