OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GVasily Petrenko conducts the
OL,6,     GRoyal Philharmonic Orchestra at
OL,7,     Gthe Glasshouse in Gateshead in
OL,8,     GTchaikovsky's Piano Concerto No.1
OL,9,     Gand Shostakovich's Symphony No.10.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,11,     FStreet - series 2
OL,12,     GDr Rommi Smith examines the music
OL,13,     Gand contributions of five leading
OL,14,     GBlack female musicians, to civil
OL,15,     Grights and social change.
OL,16,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,17,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,18,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,19,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,20,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,21,     Geverything in between.
